<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal to launch new three-year bond series.</title>
<headline>Portugal to launch new three-year bond series.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal will launch a new series of three-year, fixed-rate bonds -- March 2000 -- with a 25 billion escudo issue on Tuesday, the Institute of Public Credit Management said.  </p>
<p>There will be an additional tranche, equal to 33 percent, for market-makers.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
